"Fairlead resolves the name on the regular network and sends those addresses through the tunnel. A shared address, such as a CDN, goes through the tunnel for every app. The list refreshes when the DNS record expires." = "Fairlead 通过普通网络解析该名称，并把得到的地址送进隧道。CDN 这类共用地址会对所有应用走隧道。DNS 记录到期后，列表会重新解析。";
